' =====================================================================
'  ScholarPath — MODULE 4: Community & Chat
'  CommunityController + ChatController -> Community / Chat CQRS handlers
'  -> Domain -> Infrastructure. Real-time delivery via SignalR CommunityHub
'  and ChatHub (WebSocket). Forum moderation (flag / dismiss / auto-hide)
'  and user blocking are enforced application-side. Forum attachments use
'  Blob Storage with an optional ClamAV scan.
' =====================================================================
@startuml ScholarPath_Module4_CommunityChat
title Module 4 — Community & Chat (component view)
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #F7F8FC
  BorderColor #3F4A5A
}

node "React 19 SPA" as SPA {
  [Forum & Chat UI] as UI
}

node "Web API" as API {
  [CommunityController] as COCTRL
  [ChatController] as CHCTRL
}

node "SignalR Hubs" as HUBS {
  [CommunityHub] as COHUB
  [ChatHub] as CHUB
}

node "Application (CQRS)" as APP {
  [Community.Commands\nCreatePost · UpdatePost · DeletePost\nCreateReply · ToggleVote · ToggleBookmark\nFlagPost · DismissPostFlags · CreateCategory] as COCMD
  [Chat.Commands\nSendMessage · BlockUser · UnblockUser] as CHCMD
  [Queries\nposts · replies · categories · tags\nconversations · messages] as QRY
  [EventHandlers +\nCommunityBlockFilter] as EVT
}

node "Domain" as DOM {
  [ForumPost (posts & replies)\nForumCategory · ForumTag · ForumPostTag\nForumVote · ForumFlag · ForumBookmark\nForumPostAttachment] as COENT
  [ChatConversation · ChatMessage · UserBlock] as CHENT
}

node "Infrastructure (adapters)" as INF {
  [EF Core DbContext] as DB
  [CommunityRealtimeNotifier\n(ICommunityRealtimeNotifier)] as CONOTIF
  [ChatRealtimeNotifier\n(IChatRealtimeNotifier)] as CHNOTIF
  [PresenceTracker\n(IPresenceTracker)] as PRES
  [FileStorageService] as STORE
  [ClamAvFileScanService\n«optional»] as CLAM #FFFDE0
  [NotificationDispatcher] as NOTIF
}

database "Azure SQL" as SQL
database "Blob Storage" as BLOB

UI  --> COCTRL : REST
UI  --> CHCTRL : REST
UI  ..> COHUB  : WebSocket
UI  ..> CHUB   : WebSocket
COCTRL --> COCMD : MediatR
COCTRL --> QRY   : MediatR
CHCTRL --> CHCMD : MediatR
CHCTRL --> QRY   : MediatR
COCMD  --> COENT
CHCMD  --> CHENT
QRY    --> COENT
QRY    --> CHENT
COCMD  --> EVT
CHCMD  --> EVT
EVT    --> CONOTIF
EVT    --> CHNOTIF
EVT    --> NOTIF   : mention / reply alerts
CONOTIF --> COHUB  : push post / reply / vote
CHNOTIF --> CHUB   : push message
CHUB   --> PRES    : online presence
COCMD  --> STORE   : attachment upload
STORE  --> CLAM    : scan
COCMD  ..> DB
CHCMD  ..> DB
QRY    ..> DB
DB     --> SQL
STORE  --> BLOB

note bottom of INF
  Moderation (FlagPost / DismissPostFlags / auto-hide) and blocking are
  enforced application-side: UserBlock + CommunityBlockFilter filter
  blocked users out of chat contacts and forum feeds. Realtime notifiers
  fan out over the SignalR hubs (WebSocket); ChatHub tracks live presence.
end note
@enduml
